        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  FREOS — Bandeau offre lampo + compte à rebours (Custom Liquid, juste au-dessus de la section produit)\n  Compte à rebours vers une VRAIE heure de fin (jamais de reset). Hors fenêtre, le bandeau est invisible.\n  Programme la MÊME remise et les MÊMES dates dans Shopify (Remises > Automatique > dates début/fin).\n\n  FENÊTRES (une ligne = une fenêtre, séparées par @@) :  Début ~~ Fin   au format 2026-10-02T21:00:00+02:00  (+02:00 été, +01:00 hiver)\n  Exemple 30 min : 2026-10-02T21:00:00+02:00 ~~ 2026-10-02T21:30:00+02:00\n  Dans l'éditeur de thème, un aperçu de 30 min s'affiche pour régler le design (jamais visible par les clients).\n\n  code : le client tape ce code au checkout. Le bandeau l'affiche dans une pastille : un tap/clic la copie.\n  Le code Shopify doit avoir les MÊMES dates de début et de fin que la fenêtre.\n  Couleurs : change --fp-bg / --fp-fg dans le CSS pour t'aligner sur ton thème.\n  tight = true : le bloc supprime le padding/marge vertical de sa section pour coller au bloc suivant.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign discount = 25 -%}\n{%- assign code = 'FREOS25' -%}\n{%- assign tight = true -%}\n\n{%- capture windows_raw -%}\n{%- endcapture -%}\n\n{%- assign wins = '' -%}\n{%- if windows_raw contains '~~' -%}\n  {%- assign lines = windows_raw | strip | split: '@@' -%}\n  {%- for l in lines -%}\n    {%- assign pr = l | split: '~~' -%}\n    {%- assign a = pr[0] | strip -%}\n    {%- assign b = pr[1] | strip -%}\n    {%- if a != blank and b != blank -%}\n      {%- assign one = a | append: '|' | append: b -%}\n      {%- if wins == blank -%}{%- assign wins = one -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign wins = wins | append: ';' | append: one -%}{%- endif -%}\n    {%- endif -%}\n  {%- endfor -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- assign demo = false -%}\n{%- if wins == blank and request.design_mode -%}{%- assign demo = true -%}{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- if wins != blank or demo -%}\n<div class=\"fp\" data-fp data-windows=\"{{ wins | escape }}\" data-demo=\"{{ demo }}\" data-tight=\"{{ tight }}\" hidden>\n  <div class=\"fp__in\">\n    <div class=\"fp__copy\">\n      <p class=\"fp__t\">Offerta lampo</p>\n      <p class=\"fp__s\">{{ discount }}% di sconto con <span class=\"fp__more\">il codice </span><button class=\"fp__code\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"{{ code }}\" aria-label=\"Copia il codice {{ code }}\">{{ code }}</button><span class=\"fp__tail\"> al checkout. Poi torna il prezzo pieno.</span><span class=\"fp__sr\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fp__timer\" role=\"timer\" aria-label=\"Tempo rimasto per l'offerta\">\n      <div class=\"fp__u\"><b data-m>30</b><small>MIN</small></div>\n      <span class=\"fp__sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">:</span>\n      <div class=\"fp__u\"><b data-s>00</b><small>SEC</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .fp{--fp-bg:#1F3D2E; --fp-fg:#FFFFFF; --fp-radius:10px;\n    display:block; width:100%; margin:0 0 14px; color:var(--fp-fg); background:var(--fp-bg); border-radius:var(--fp-radius); font-family:inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n  .fp[hidden]{display:none !important}\n  .fp *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .fp__in{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:14px 16px}\n  .fp__copy{min-width:0}\n  .fp__t{margin:0; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase}\n  .fp__s{margin:5px 0 0; font-size:13px; font-weight:400; line-height:1.35; color:rgba(255,255,255,.82)}\n  .fp__more{display:none}\n  .fp__code{display:inline-block; margin:0; padding:1px 7px; border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-radius:6px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); color:#fff; font:inherit; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.06em; line-height:1.35; cursor:pointer; appearance:none; -webkit-appearance:none; transition:background .2s ease, color .2s ease, border-color .2s ease}\n  .fp__code:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}\n  .fp__code:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #A8BFA3; outline-offset:2px}\n  .fp__code.is-copied{background:#A8BFA3; border-color:#A8BFA3; color:#1F3D2E}\n  .fp__tail{display:none}\n  .fp__sr{position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0 0 0 0); white-space:nowrap}\n\n  .fp__timer{display:flex; align-items:flex-start; flex:none; gap:6px}\n  .fp__u{display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; min-width:2.1rem}\n  .fp__u b{font-size:24px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.05; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .fp__u small{margin-top:4px; font-size:9px; font-weight:500; line-height:1; letter-spacing:.14em; opacity:.62}\n  .fp__sep{font-size:24px; font-weight:400; line-height:1.05; opacity:.5}\n\n  @media (max-width:400px){\n    .fp__in{gap:8px; padding:12px 10px}\n    .fp__t{font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.08em}\n    .fp__s{font-size:12px}\n    .fp__code{padding:0 5px; letter-spacing:.04em}\n    .fp__u{min-width:1.75rem}\n    .fp__u b, .fp__sep{font-size:22px}\n    .fp__timer{gap:3px}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:340px){\n    .fp__in{gap:6px; padding:12px 8px}\n    .fp__s{font-size:11px}\n    .fp__code{letter-spacing:.02em}\n    .fp__u{min-width:1.6rem}\n    .fp__u b, .fp__sep{font-size:20px}\n  }\n  @media (min-width:768px){\n    .fp__in{justify-content:center; gap:40px; padding:16px 24px}\n    .fp__t{font-size:13px}\n    .fp__s{font-size:14px}\n    .fp__more{display:inline}\n    .fp__u{min-width:2.4rem}\n    .fp__u b, .fp__sep{font-size:26px}\n  }\n  @media (min-width:1024px){\n    .fp__tail{display:inline}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-fp]:not([data-fp-ready])').forEach(function (root) {\n      root.setAttribute('data-fp-ready', '');\n\n      if (root.getAttribute('data-tight') === 'true') {\n        var n = root.parentElement, hops = 0;\n        while (n && n !== document.body && hops < 8) {\n          n.style.setProperty('padding-top', '0', 'important');\n          n.style.setProperty('padding-bottom', '0', 'important');\n          n.style.setProperty('margin-top', '0', 'important');\n          n.style.setProperty('margin-bottom', '0', 'important');\n          if (n.classList && n.classList.contains('shopify-section')) break;\n          n = n.parentElement; hops++;\n        }\n      }\n\n      var wins = (root.getAttribute('data-windows') || '').split(';').map(function (s) {\n        var a = s.split('|'); return [Date.parse(a[0]), Date.parse(a[1])];\n      }).filter(function (w) { return isFinite(w[0]) && isFinite(w[1]) && w[1] > w[0]; });\n      if (root.getAttribute('data-demo') === 'true') wins = [[Date.now() - 1000, Date.now() + 30 * 60 * 1000]];\n\n      var elM = root.querySelector('[data-m]'), elS = root.querySelector('[data-s]');\n      var timer = null;\n      function pad(n) { return (n < 10 ? '0' : '') + n; }\n      function tick() {\n        var now = Date.now(), cur = null, upcoming = false;\n        for (var i = 0; i < wins.length; i++) {\n          if (now >= wins[i][0] && now < wins[i][1]) { cur = wins[i]; break; }\n          if (wins[i][0] > now) upcoming = true;\n        }\n        if (!cur) {\n          root.hidden = true;\n          if (!upcoming && timer) { clearInterval(timer); timer = null; }\n          return;\n        }\n        var s = Math.floor((cur[1] - now) / 1000);\n        elM.textContent = pad(Math.floor(s / 60)); elS.textContent = pad(s % 60);\n        root.hidden = false;\n      }\n\n      var btn = root.querySelector('[data-copy]');\n      if (btn) {\n        var c = btn.getAttribute('data-copy');\n        var fallback = function () {\n          var t = document.createElement('textarea');\n          t.value = c; t.setAttribute('readonly', ''); t.style.position = 'fixed'; t.style.opacity = '0';\n          document.body.appendChild(t); t.select();\n          var ok = false; try { ok = document.execCommand('copy'); } catch (e) {}\n          document.body.removeChild(t); return ok;\n        };\n        var sr = root.querySelector('.fp__sr');\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n          var done = function (ok) {\n            if (!ok) return;\n            btn.classList.add('is-copied'); if (sr) sr.textContent = 'Codice copiato';\n            setTimeout(function () { btn.classList.remove('is-copied'); if (sr) sr.textContent = ''; }, 1600);\n          };\n          if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n            navigator.clipboard.writeText(c).then(function () { done(true); }, function () { done(fallback()); });\n          } else { done(fallback()); }\n        });\n      }\n      tick();\n      timer = setInterval(tick, 1000);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n{%- endif -%}",
        "background": "",
